    "detailed_description": "20 Doors is a first person exploration, action and puzzle solving adventure where strange events and environments make you question your sanity. <br><br>Lost and confused, your adventure starts on a small makeshift pier. <br>The sand is thick and mucky; the smell is sour and it makes your eyes water.<br>There seems to be only one thing you can do: move forward into the dark misty unknown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495340/extras/56bd36c7c87e3b92667a7a9ec19c93c0.avif?t=1689959284\" /></span><br><br>Let your imagination wander as you explore a variety of odd yet facinating locations and face the untrustworthy things lurking in the shadows.<br>Answer those questions that might naturally appear the farther and deeper you go.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495340/extras/f0bfb3fe398b06123469bed280b14974.avif?t=1689959284\" /></span><br><br>Will you dare to step deeper in the dark misty forests or peak behind that moldy wall as you constantly ask yourself;<br>has it been watching me the whole time?<br><br>With high quality graphics, global illumination and ambient occlusion for improved lighting; as well HDR support.",
